            "review_text": "Steph N\nLondon, United Kingdom14 contributions\n1\nGreat food, great service, welcoming and friendly restaurant\nMar 2023 • Couples\nMy husband and I loved it so much we came both nights in a row! Friendly and welcoming staff, clean and good food with good portion sizes! The spring rolls are AMAZING - the best we’ve had so far in Vietnam! We also tried their ‘Happy Water’ - both the plain rice wine and the plum one - actually really tasty! You have to try 🤗\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 27, 2023\nHà Linh\nthanks you so much ! hope to see you again one day soon <3\nWritten March 28, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
